codex
The root cause is the sandbox’s PID/proc view, not the project: Lean 4.22 computes its executable path as `/proc/<getpid>/exe`, while this container exposes only `/proc/self/exe`; the numeric path returns `ENOENT`. I’m applying a temporary process-local `readlink` shim for the build only. It does not touch the pinned toolchain, dependency configuration, Base, or theorem source.
